      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, the prose is definitely elegant. I just ran it through the tool and the \"Descriptive Richness\" score came back a bit lower than I'd like for a feature piece in Gastronomy Weekly. It's not a dealbreaker, but I want this to really pop and feel \"high-end\" for our readers. \n\nCould you try another version? Just try to lean into the descriptions a bit more to get that richness score up. But seriously, please don't overdo it—I don't want it to look like you're just throwing adjectives at the wall. Just make it feel a bit more lush and vivid.",
